{"step_index":394,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-19T06:49:40Z","thinking":"**Examining Repository Contents**\n\nI'm currently looking into the repository directory to understand the current structure and contents, trying to make sure I grasp the layout before uploading anything. I intend to fully upload the files, fixes, improvements, memory, chat history, markdown files, absolutely everything, into the same repo from which it was cloned.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"python -c \"\nimport os, shutil\n\nrepo_dir = r'C:\\Users\\Bullettemporary\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\dump-garbage'\nbrain_dir = r'C:\\Users\\Bullettemporary\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\da9e9c42-5baf-4b67-90a8-709001879963'\nscratch_dir = r'C:\\Users\\Bullettemporary\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch'\n\n# Create archive folders in repo\narchive_dir = os.path.join(repo_dir, 'session_archive')\nos.makedirs(archive_dir, exist_ok=True)\n\n# Copy all .md files, screenshots, logs from brain\nfor root, dirs, files in os.walk(brain_dir):\n    rel = os.path.relpath(root, brain_dir)\n    target_dir = os.path.join(archive_dir, rel) if rel != '.' else archive_dir\n    os.makedirs(target_dir, exist_ok=True)\n    for f in files:\n        # Ignore raw big ppm files and sockets/temp locks if any\n        if f.endswith('.ppm') or f.endswith('.iso'):\n            continue\n        src_path = os.path.join(root, f)\n        dest_path = os.path.join(target_dir, f)\n        try:\n            shutil.copy2(src_path, dest_path)\n        except Exception as e:\n            print(f'Error copying {f}: {e}')\n\n# Copy scratch single-file html if present\nendroid_html = os.path.join(scratch_dir, 'endroid-os-index.html')\nif os.path.exists(endroid_html):\n    shutil.copy2(endroid_html, os.path.join(repo_dir, 'endroid-os-index.html'))\n\nprint('Copied brain, chat history transcripts, memory, and artifacts to dump-garbage repository.')\n\"","Cwd